### Place a SELL Order (E-Bike)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exchange/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "type": "SELL",
  "amount": 5.0,
  "price": 10.00,
  "timestamp": "2026-06-04T10:00:00Z"
}

### Place a BUY Order (Gas Van)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exchange/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courierId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "type": "BUY",
  "amount": 5.0,
  "price": 12.00,
  "timestamp": "2026-06-04T10:00:01Z"
}

### View the Order Book
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exchange/orderbook

### View Trade History
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/exchange/trades